    "created_at": "2022-06-27T10:46:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-27T10:46:44Z",
    "body": "> Sorry for create noise here, does anyone know timeline for browers plan to support this?\r\n\r\nWe've filed implementation bugs with all major browser vendors, see https://github.com/whatwg/streams/issues/778#issuecomment-461341033. From there, it's up to each individual browser vendor to implement this change as they see fit.\r\n\r\nYou can star the [Chromium issue](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=929585) and/or vote on the [Firefox bug](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1734244) in order to let them know that you're interested in this feature. Or, if you're willing to put in the effort, you can contribute an implementation yourself. 😉 (Do post a comment on the bug first to inform them that you're working on it though, so they don't end up doing duplicate work.)",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
